  "reference_solution": "[정답] $7$\n\n[해설]\n$- 1 \\le \\sin \\left( x - \\frac{\\pi}{3} \\right) \\le 1$이고\n함수 $f \\left( x \\right) = 4 \\sin \\left( x - \\frac{\\pi}{3} \\right) + a$의 최솟값이 $1$이므로\n$- 4 + a = 1$, $a = 5$\n따라서\n$f \\left( \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)$$= 4 \\sin \\left( \\frac{\\pi}{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{3} \\right) + 5$\n$= 4 \\sin \\frac{\\pi}{6} + 5$\n$= 4 \\times \\frac{1}{2} + 5 = 7$\n",
